  "title": "OMP integration: pi-coding-agent 18.2.11 → 18.4.5",
  "summary": "Bumps the `@oh-my-pi/pi-coding-agent` dev dependency of the `integrations/omp` workspace package from 18.2.11 to 18.4.5 and regenerates the pnpm lockfile. The whole `@oh-my-pi/*` family moves in lockstep to 18.4.5, sharp moves to 0.35.5 with libvips 1.3.4, and the new agent version drops its Tailwind/chart.js dashboard stack (tailwindcss, @tailwindcss/node, chart.js, react-chartjs-2, lightningcss 1.32, magic-string, enhanced-resolve, graceful-fs, tapable, @jridgewell/*) while picking up lucide-react 1.51.0 and a new optional `@types/react` peer. No application source changes; the effect is confined to what the OMP integration installs and links against.",
